==Levels 1/33-43: Combat==

=== Level 1: Strike spells through splashing and Slayer ===
Casting combat spells at early levels can be a good way to train [[Magic]], [[Hitpoints]], and optionally, [[Defence]]. Players who are able to give full attention are '''highly recommended''' to use these early levels to train [[Slayer]]. Use an [[elemental staff]], purchasable from [[Zaff's Staffs]]. Early money for runes can be obtained by collecting the 10,000 [[coins]] from the [[Stronghold of Security]], subduing [[Wintertodt]], training [[Ironman Guide/Thieving|Thieving]], collecting and selling [[Eclipse red|Eclipse Red]], or doing the [[Agility Pyramid]]. 

